    "evidence": "Independently compared own primary-first compact-C2 contract, exact1581-byte seal and all7 fresh blind strings; inspected entire production (two private literal definitions and private compact_observer), complete Tests and all5 readable formula steps. Genuine parent35 produces the same allN Bool-count pushforward laws; finite map measurability, probability-based compact-observer L1, Integrable.comp_measurable, actual integral_map_of_stronglyMeasurable and root ofCompactSupport weak tests supply each domain/limit internally. Continuous tlogt at0 gives the homogeneous entropy limit without positive-mass or normalization premises. N0 derivative expectation remains fprime(0)^2, possibly nonzero. Current packet/publication-context/binding and acyclic archived-initial-lease decoder basis hashes independently recomputed; all88 frozen raw/LF inputs match. Prior exhaustive114region/1195line source-only topology review reused at unchanged pins and explicitly distinguished from current implementation admission. Scoped authored background only; fullflip4/GaussianLSI/noncompact/Hilbert/T2/FIRST4.6/main/work remain OPEN. No compiler run or inherited math-verdict inference.",
